      "data": {
        "filepath": "", "lang": "None", "width": 36,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / ORIGINALS 014\nFOLD DRIVE CINEMATIC MOTION\n\nPLAY: 8-channel MIDI poly chords.\nMIDI gate opens ADSR -> VCA.\nMorph VCO -> FoldDrive -> Filter LP ->\nVCA -> two nominal HostAudio inputs.\n\nFoldDrive DRIVE 58%, BIAS 0, MIX 48%.\nLFO TRI -> FoldDrive DRIVE CV.\nLFO SIN -> FoldDrive BIAS CV.\nMIDI MOD WHEEL -> FoldDrive MIX CV.\nMIDI AFTERTOUCH -> VCO MORPH CV.\n\nLFO is 0.25Hz free-running, NOT\nhost-tempo locked. Sine-folding is not\nbandlimited; high drive may alias.\nFoldDrive outputs bounded +/-10V, but\na polyphonic sum can still clip later.\n\nVCA 0.18, HostAudio2 0.12 saved.\nMonitor quietly: real DAW sound,\nCPU and clipping remain unverified.\n"
      },
      "pos": [27, 1]
